erobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`: 0.12.13 -> 0.12.14\n* `onetaskgraph-github-projects`: 0.12.13 -> 0.12.14\n* `onetaskgraph-in-memory`: 0.12.13 -> 0.12.14\n* `onetaskgraph-linear`: 0.12.13 -> 0.12.14\n* `onetaskgraph-local-md`: 0.12.13 -> 0.12.14\n* `onetaskgraph-core`: 0.12.13 -> 0.12.14\n* `onetaskgraph`: 0.12.13 -> 0.12.14\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.12.14](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.12.13...onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.12.14) - 2026-10-31\n\n### Added\n\n- *(copy)* make a create safe to retry and guard a copy's status and priority writes ([#3838](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3838))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-github-projects`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.12.14](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-github-projects-v0.12.13...onetaskgraph-github-projects-v0.12.14) - 2026-10-31\n\n### Added\n\n- *(copy)* make a create safe to retry and guard a copy's status and priority writes ([#3838](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3838))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-in-memory`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.14](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-in-memory-v0.12.13...onetaskgraph-in-memory-v0.12.14) - 2026-10-31\n\n### Added\n\n- *(copy)* make a create safe to retry and guard a copy's status and priority writes ([#3838](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3838))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-linear`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.14](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-linear-v0.12.13...onetaskgraph-linear-v0.12.14) - 2026-10-31\n\n### Added\n\n- *(copy)* make a create safe to retry and guard a copy's status and priority writes ([#3838](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3838))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-local-md`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.14](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-local-md-v0.12.13...onetaskgraph-local-md-v0.12.14) - 2026-10-31\n\n### Added\n\n- *(copy)* make a create safe to retry and guard a copy's status and priority writes ([#3838](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3838))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-core`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.14](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.13...onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.14) - 2026-10-31\n\n### Added\n\n- *(copy)* make a create safe to retry and guard a copy's status and priority writes ([#3838](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3838))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.14](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/v0.12.13...v0.12.14) - 2026-10-31\n\n### Added\n\n- *(copy)* make a create safe to retry and guard a copy's status and priority writes ([#3838](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3838))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-31T14:55:11Z","updated_a