scriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3838","id":5096631880,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABL8huSA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3838","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3838.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3838.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3838","number":3838,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(copy): make a create safe to retry and guard a copy's status and priority writes","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nCopies now recover interrupted creates through stored intents, source leases and deterministic create keys. Adds destination-status and priority guards, GitHub Projects `creation_owners` restrictions, and copy/task-write results reporting status, priority and the available version without another read. Both SDKs, generated schemas, documentation and CLI journeys cover the new behavior.\n\n## Why\n\nRetrying a timed-out copy can create duplicate cards, splitting comments and later edits between them. Keeping recovery, field protections and repository restrictions at the write lets callers sync without rebuilding those rules or spending shared API quota on extra reads.\n\n## Additional info\n\nRetry protection excludes new `--no-link` creates and sources that cannot store an intent. Local-md locks coordinate processes on one host; remote-source leases are advisory. GitHub duplicates are detected only when both issues are visible by the post-create repository listing; later visibility can leave an unreported duplicate. Stdio-hosted destinations retain their existing create behavior.\n\nStatus-guard refusals are per-item failures: other items proceed, and the CLI exits 4 with a copy report that both SDKs parse. Write-result versions are nullable where the source cannot provide a current token without another read.","created_at":"2026-10-31T10:17:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T14:53:11Z","closed_at":"2026-10-31T14:53:09Z","merged_at":"2026-10-31T14:53:09Z","merge_commit_sha":"066a7c9a07f55c85b91a396c0376780cccb676b3","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3838/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3838/comments","review_comment