ps://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/b875ba47527e8356bae5a3b2fd8554bdd573da37"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3160","id":4716617654,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABGSHftg","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3160","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3160.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3160.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3160","number":3160,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(linear): bring the Linear source to parity with GitHub Projects","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nBring Linear plan and follow-up writes to parity with GitHub Projects: named workflow-state mappings, project-scoped sources, metadata and rendering updates, and cross-source delivery propagation. Add native follow-up search narrowings, scope cross-source edge lookups, and expose configuration and workflow-state reports through the CLI and both SDKs. Status filters match how issues read back, including unmapped review states.\n\n## Why\n\nExampleOrg work needs to live where its team plans and tracks it—in Linear—while personal libraries stay on GitHub Projects. Mixed work must remain one connected task graph, with distinct workflow states and a dedicated Linear follow-ups project.\n\n## Additional info\n\nLinear normalizes bare HTML-comment payloads in issue descriptions and documents. Metadata now uses a code-span-protected slot; existing multiline slots remain readable and adopt the new encoding on write. Comment bodies preserve HTML comments unchanged.","created_at":"2026-10-02T12:48:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T15:18:20Z","closed_at":"2026-10-02T14:18:09Z","merged_at":"2026-10-02T14:18:09Z","merge_commit_sha":"0b53040e2e36e7c29007b67e9197e5c251b4fbe3","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3160/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3160/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3160/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/97f420c54ed1972653cf8e04734b27bc8b023374","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/3087/otg-linear-parity","ref":"nick/3087/otg-linear-parity","sha":"97f420c54ed1972653cf8e04734b27bc8b023374","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","foll