s/onetaskgraph/pulls/3160/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/97f420c54ed1972653cf8e04734b27bc8b023374"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3159","id":4716614580,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABGSHTtA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3159","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3159.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3159.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3159","number":3159,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(store): route work by repository and link member projects","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAdd repository-based routing for task creation and copies, with linked member projects keeping work across sources readable as one paged plan. Projects whose tasks all route together take their home and documents with them; mixed plans retain their home and place routed tasks in member projects. Existing homes stay in place as tasks are added.\n\nExpose route previews and member reads through the CLI and both SDKs. Copies report placement, refuse implicit moves of existing counterparts, and undo writes across destinations on failure. Configurations without routes retain existing behavior.\n\n## Why\n\nExampleOrg work should land in Linear, where its team tracks it, while personal library work stays on GitHub Projects. Routing by repository makes placement automatic across writers, and linked member projects keep work spanning both organizations connected as one goal and dependency graph.","created_at":"2026-10-02T12:48:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T15:18:17Z","closed_at":"2026-10-02T16:34:56Z","merged_at":"2026-10-02T16:34:55Z","merge_commit_sha":"fad3a52290fa644a0800da1a792b9f47bc6a5bd8","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3159/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3159/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3159/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/149be1c920bc82afe33c51fe1f4f2bd9dd502920","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/3088/otg-route-and-members","ref":"nick/3088/otg-route-and-members","sha":"149be1c920bc82afe33c51fe1f4f2bd9dd502920","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_ur