kderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`: 0.12.12 -> 0.12.13\n* `onetaskgraph-github-projects`: 0.12.12 -> 0.12.13\n* `onetaskgraph-linear`: 0.12.12 -> 0.12.13\n* `onetaskgraph-core`: 0.12.12 -> 0.12.13\n* `onetaskgraph`: 0.12.12 -> 0.12.13\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.12.13](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.12.12...onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.12.13) - 2026-10-30\n\n### Added\n\n- project human tasks through existing tracker routing ([#3824](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3824))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-github-projects`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.12.13](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-github-projects-v0.12.12...onetaskgraph-github-projects-v0.12.13) - 2026-10-30\n\n### Added\n\n- project human tasks through existing tracker routing ([#3824](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3824))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-linear`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.13](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-linear-v0.12.12...onetaskgraph-linear-v0.12.13) - 2026-10-30\n\n### Added\n\n- project human tasks through existing tracker routing ([#3824](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3824))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-core`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.13](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.12...onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.13) - 2026-10-30\n\n### Added\n\n- project human tasks through existing tracker routing ([#3824](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3824))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.13](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/v0.12.12...v0.12.13) - 2026-10-30\n\n### Added\n\n- project human tasks through existing tracker routing ([#3824](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3824))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-30T00:11:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:28:13Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T08:28:11Z","merged_at":"2026-10-30T08:28:11Z","merge_commit_sha":"3b6b228f168ab17c94613a831e1eec96a225d949","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3826/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3826/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3826/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/05c2e2d37191f3bf8ec46c7f675f6b854fdc13b3","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:release-plz-2026-10-30T00-11-45Z","ref":"release-plz-2026-10-30T00-11-45Z","sha":"05c2e2d37191f3bf8ec46c7f675f6b854fdc13b3","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/