ec46c7f675f6b854fdc13b3"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":{"enabled_by":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3825","id":5074483572,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABLnZ5dA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3825","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3825.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3825.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3825","number":3825,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"ci: warm the pull-request Rust cache on every push to main","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nWarm the shared Linux and Windows Rust caches on pushes to main for #3642’s pull-request test jobs, without running tests. Guard cache-key, toolchain and build-input parity, check Linux dependency reuse, and make the warmer’s test harness compatible with native Windows executables.\n\n## Why\n\nThe owner needs real warm-cache pull-request timings to decide the CI budget. Landing the warmer separately makes those measurements possible before the rest of the CI speed-up lands.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe consumer jobs are captured from [#3642](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3642) at `ef1322ea6c3a` until they land in `ci.yml`; the parity check rejects duplicate definitions, so the corresponding fixtures must be removed when the jobs land. Existing CI jobs and budget files are unchanged. macOS warming remains with #3642.","created_at":"2026-10-29T19:43:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:47:48Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T05:47:46Z","merged_at":"2026-10-30T05:47:46Z","merge_commit_sha":"e2d3bf08e0ced82120f38a708dc2b7a92d26ce7f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3825/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3825/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3825/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/6ceb048ef514cf6cdd3837a2ff99d24b664cd3a6","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/ci-time-budgets-wave1/onetaskgraph-rust-cache-warmer","ref":"nick/ci-time-budgets-wave1/onetaskgraph-rust-cache-warmer","sha":"6ceb048ef514cf6cdd3837a2ff99d24b664cd3a6","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1343250630,"node_id":"R_kgDOUBBgxg","name":"onetaskgraph","full_name":"nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.co