},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3824","id":5073734903,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABLmsM9w","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3824","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3824.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3824.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3824","number":3824,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: project human tasks through existing tracker routing","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAdds `onetaskgraph task project-human --input FILE --json` and typed Python/TypeScript SDK support to create, retry, complete or dismiss human tasks in GitHub and Linear. Durable claims preserve ticket identity across retries and return canonical issue URLs; dismissal reasons remain optional.\n\nPurpose-scoped routing uses existing projects, keeps private and mixed-repository work out of public destinations, and preserves legacy routing. Adds recovery, privacy and approval lifecycle journeys, plus saved-telemetry budgets for projection and complete approval costs.\n\n## Why\n\nA single visible queue lets the operator focus on the most urgent human work while unrelated development continues during a decision.\n\n## Additional info\n\nProjection destinations require an authoritative host and an absolute intent directory; planless tasks also need a configured project. Ambiguous creates refuse for reconciliation instead of risking duplicate tickets, and conflicting terminal states refuse. GitHub placement context persists across processes and is reused only after validating its setup token. Terminal body changes use the current tracker body. See [the projection contract and configuration](docs/task-projection.md).\n\nThe registered limits are 7.3 modeled GraphQL points per task lifecycle and 13 per complete approval, including review task creation and resolution. Reporters read saved journey telemetry, with each measured create and terminal projection running in its own cold CLI process; these are loopback cost budgets, not live quota observations.","created_at":"2026-10-29T18:47:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T00:10:07Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T00:10:04Z","merged_at":"2026-10-30T00:10:04Z","merge_commit_sha":"f01c39962783f51a32ef75e9f33d53c5c71c664a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3824/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3824/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3824/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickdero