https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/deployments","created_at":"2026-08-23T00:02:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T23:21:48Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-01T00:47:19Z","git_url":"git://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","homepage":null,"size":16538,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":127,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":127,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3809"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3809"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3809"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3809/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3809/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3809/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/710b6066ec70cb1e9e207c30ad263e2ca954c6c9"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3807","id":5054413968,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABLUQ8kA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3807","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3807.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3807.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3807","number":3807,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(linear): keep the live capability journey passing now Linear rewrites document Markdown","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nMake the live Linear journey wait within its existing bounds for exact document content and newly created projects, preserving assertions and the test timeout. Document and test the unchanged document contract: writes send Markdown with source metadata; reads return Linear’s stored Markdown with that metadata removed, without promising the caller’s original bytes.\n\n## Why\n\nRequired live checks were failing on unrelated pull requests. These checks must tolerate delayed visibility while still rejecting content that violates the stated contract; each document update’s response is now checked exactly too.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe [original hosted failure](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/actions/runs/40721997875) read back content matching the preceding HTML-comment probe byte for byte after the Markdown probe’s update. A read lagging that update is a working hypothesis, not an established cause.\n\nCommitted fixtures record bare-URL autolinking, bracket escaping, and comment-terminator escaping, with before/after text and run provenance. Recorded-response tests exercise the source’s write/read interface for rewritten content and preserved code-span payloads.\n\nThe subsequent [required check](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/actions/runs/40734970799/job/122981726950) failed before the document probes because the project listing omitted both newly created projects; the log does not establish why. The journey now retries the complete listing within its existing index bound, still requiring both projects. Tests cover delayed visibility across pages and permanent absence; disabling retries makes the recovery test fail. GitHub rejected the attempted job rerun.\n\nThe [later required check](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/actions/runs/40745835641/job/123019623824) failed in both Linear live suites because document creation returned `QUOTA_EXCEEDED` at the team’s 1,000-document limit. It reported no Markdown or project-listing assertion failure, but does not establish that those checks pass. Quota cleanup is separate work.\n\nThe [llmlint failure](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/actions/runs/40884579679/job/123484756025) identified the Linear fixture’s classification in a shared scripts registry. That classification now lives beside the fixture in the Linear crate. The fixture guard reads these local declarations and tests rejection of missing, duplicate, invalid, or unexplained entries; the scripts project includes them in its inputs.\n\nLocal verification recorded on the finished tree: all 148 Linear tests passed with live credentials removed, along with Linear Clippy and formatting, scripts lint, and llmlint’s static validation. The graph, workspace-configuration, and affected-selection checks also passed. Model-based llmlint could not run locally because `oneharness` was unavailable; no successful model-based lint or live API run is claimed.\n\n### Deferred comparison against real Linear\n\nNot yet performed. This pull request’s required live capability journey, `real_linear_applies_every_declared_capability_and_leaves_no_residue` on test-linux, provides the verdict once quota cleanup permits it to run. Compare against real Linear:\n\n- All three rewrites in `crates/onetaskgraph-linear/tests/fixtures/document-content-40721997875.json`: bare `example.com` → `[example.com](<http://example.com>)`, `[1]` → `\\[1\\]`, and a line-opening `-->` → `\\-->`.\n- Both exact document probes in `tests/live.rs`: `PROBE` → `PROBE_STORED` and `MARKDOWN_PROBE` → `MARKDOWN_PROBE_STORED`, checked in each update’s response and subsequent reads.\n\nExact matches would be consistent with the read-lag hypothesis, without proving it. A mismatch requires investigating the returned content and revisiting the recorded expectations and contract as appropriate.","created_at":"2026-10-28T16:58:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:48:02Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T15:47:59Z","merged_at":"2026-10-29T15:47:59Z","merge_commit_sha":"1af42438189b2acc31fc86da15782985d88a5ea7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3807/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3807/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3807/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/093e22ee768ae3d2cffd557681143baff96b6492","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/ci-time-budgets-wave1/onetaskgraph-linear-markdown-rewrite","ref":"nick/ci-time-budgets-wave1/onetaskgraph-linear-markdown-rewrite","sha":"093e22ee768ae3d2cffd557681143baff96b6492","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https:/