h/pulls/3816","id":5060860352,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABLaaZwA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3816","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3816.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3816.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3816","number":3816,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(scripts): never cache a failed upstream read in the loopback registry proxy","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nThe loopback release registry now caches only successful upstream index reads, allowing the next request after a failure to reach upstream again. HTTP regression coverage exercises failure, recovery, and subsequent cache reuse for HTTP errors and dropped connections.\n\n## Why\n\nRelease journeys are required on every pull request. Caching a transient crates.io failure made every later Cargo retry fail even after upstream recovered, blocking unrelated work. This fixes the cause of that flakiness instead of relying on rerunning jobs until green.","created_at":"2026-10-29T02:09:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:57:20Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T07:57:18Z","merged_at":"2026-10-29T07:57:18Z","merge_commit_sha":"14e32a4781bf0b0c08b1a673f1a42afe8b5d4821","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3816/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3816/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3816/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/43fc0603b1e3dc2202668499364e37532bb77306","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/ci-time-budgets-wave1/onetaskgraph-registry-proxy-no-cached-failure","ref":"nick/ci-time-budgets-wave1/onetaskgraph-registry-proxy-no-cached-failure","sha":"43fc0603b1e3dc2202668499364e37532bb77306","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderober