/onetaskgraph/pull/3813.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3813","number":3813,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(ci): key the Rust caches on the pinned toolchain only","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nStabilize Rust cache keys by removing the runner’s unused floating stable toolchain before cache restoration, while keeping Rust 1.97.1 pinned. Regression tests guard cleanup ordering and execution across pull-request and cache-warming jobs, and exercise the real cache action to prove floating stable changes preserve the key while pin and lockfile changes invalidate it.\n\n## Why\n\nMain needs to warm caches under the corrected key before pull-request timings can guide CI improvements. Landing this fix independently of the larger [CI rework (#3642)](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3642) enables meaningful warm-cache measurements without waiting for that rework.","created_at":"2026-10-28T21:41:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:41:41Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T06:41:38Z","merged_at":"2026-10-29T06:41:38Z","merge_commit_sha":"e7295a5744794b5ec3c3e930c84b275f626ea6f9","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3813/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3813/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3813/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/981072305e8116ff8f5eca845694bfb723eb62e5","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/ci-time-budgets-wave1/onetaskgraph-rust-cache-key","ref":"nick/ci-time-budgets-wave1/onetaskgraph-rust-cache-key","sha":"981072305e8116ff8f5eca845694bfb723eb62e5","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id"