hub.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`: 0.12.9 -> 0.12.10\n* `onetaskgraph-linear`: 0.12.9 -> 0.12.10\n* `onetaskgraph-core`: 0.12.9 -> 0.12.10\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.12.10](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.12.9...onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.12.10) - 2026-10-29\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(deps)* move pulldown-cmark past the wikilink event-growth advisory ([#3802](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3802))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-linear`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.10](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-linear-v0.12.9...onetaskgraph-linear-v0.12.10) - 2026-10-29\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(live)* keep the Linear test team under its document limit ([#3811](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3811))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-core`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.10](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.9...onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.10) - 2026-10-29\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(deps)* move pulldown-cmark past the wikilink event-growth advisory ([#3802](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3802))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-28T15:09:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T04:05:44Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T04:05:42Z","merged_at":"2026-10-29T04:05:42Z","merge_commit_sha":"61670507ec7d419abd1cb677458430e1228c7b5e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3803/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3803/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3803/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/fdd0a665a490bb1bc7641b1b5374b0abe20faa6f","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:release-plz-2026-10-28T15-09-03Z","ref":"release-plz-2026-10-28T15-09-03Z","sha":"fdd0a665a490bb1bc7641b1b5374b0abe20faa6f","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"