/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3811","id":5056587337,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABLWVmSQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3811","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3811.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3811.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3811","number":3811,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(live): keep the Linear test team under its document limit","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAdd scheduled cleanup of abandoned Linear test documents older than 24 hours in the nominated test team, and stamp asset-journey documents so cleanup recognizes them. Preserve ordinary, fresh and ambiguously owned documents; retain every live assertion and journey.\n\n## Why\n\nThe required live asset journey hit Linear’s 1000-document team limit in [run 40741930571, test-linux](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/actions/runs/40741930571/job/123005634093), blocking unrelated pull requests. Recovering abandoned documents addresses the cause without weakening the required check.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBoth Linear live journeys normally delete their documents, but interrupted runners cannot finish cleanup. The local orphan sweep requires locks from the originating machine, the scheduled janitor previously covered only GitHub, and asset documents had titles no orphan sweep recognized. The [cleanup report](docs/linear-live-cleanup.md) records the producing paths and code evidence; the exact composition of the existing backlog was not inspected. Existing untagged residue remains untouched and needs the user’s one-time cleanup to restore capacity.\n\nTen subprocess journeys exercise the real janitor against schema-derived response fixtures, proving abandoned test documents are removed and ordinary documents preserved. These fixtures are not captured account data; no credentialed Linear run was verified.\n\nThe fixture formatting failure in [run 40767548268, check (windows-latest)](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/actions/runs/40767548268/job/123102092578) is repaired. The report records passing uncached, serial tests, lint, formatting and type checks for all six touched projects, plus workspace formatting and model lint. Hosted Windows verification remains pending. The release-publication case passed on this branch and at main’s checked tip, `057b6c30b35314d1c2a70daef1feec3f5b14ef67`.","created_at":"2026-10-28T19:38:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T02:14:21Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T02:14:19Z","merged_at":"2026-10-29T02:14:19Z","merge_commit_sha":"6a3d01bd5f83db32afd57bbe38b3c05df7005611","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3811/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3811/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3811/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/6c344077bfb0f5695c7e0ae3ba550fffb5521b0f","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/ci-time-budgets-wave1/onetaskgraph-linear-document-limit","ref":"nick/ci-time-budgets-wave1/onetaskgraph-linear-document-limit","sha":"6c344077bfb0f5695c7e0ae3ba550fffb5521b0f","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repo