"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":127,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3791"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3791"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3791"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3791/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3791/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3791/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/8fc6f8c4657a0cb5302d7d26d8216e242cbf0fbb"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3795","id":5046364375,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABLMlo1w","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3795","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3795.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3795.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3795","number":3795,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"docs(measurements): measure plan copies and approval against the targets","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAdd the [seven-operation GitHub measurement report](docs/measurements/board-copy-targets-2026-10-26.md) at onetaskgraph 0.12.7, with sanitized captures, a repeatable measurement harness and an analyzer that recomputes every table and refuses drift or invalid captures. Covers private-source copies, screened host copies and approval, including request costs, writes, timing attribution and board-size evidence.\n\n## Why\n\nReal GitHub measurements at the host’s adopted releases show how long copy and approval actually take, how much shared allowance they spend, and which remaining delays need a decision.\n\n## Additional info\n\nAll points and applicable writes figures are within target under the report’s approved pricing method: GitHub dry-run query costs plus an assumed one point per mutation request. Raw quota readings and sensitivity to higher mutation prices remain explicit.\n\nThree host timings remain over target: changed re-copy at 10.0 s versus 8 s, unchanged re-copy at 7.4 s versus 7 s, and approval at 9.5 s versus 7 s. The report attributes their time and records the approved workload and measurement-method departures; it changes no budgets.","created_at":"2026-10-28T06:44:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:19:02Z","closed_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:59Z","merged_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:59Z","merge_commit_sha":"67fbc4cd1851884ca595ab1c6a566ecd53fa839f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3795/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3795/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3795/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/d68e98947d09ad0bf6a801a89c4861888ac9d242","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/3772/measure-targets","ref":"nick/3772/measure-targets","sha":"d68e98947d09ad0bf6a801a89c4861888ac9d242","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1343250630,"node_id":"R_kgDOUBBgxg","name":"onetaskgraph","full_name":"nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","private":false,"owner":{"login"