thub.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onetaskgraph-local-md`: 0.12.7 -> 0.12.8\n* `onetaskgraph-core`: 0.12.7 -> 0.12.8\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-local-md`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.8](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-local-md-v0.12.7...onetaskgraph-local-md-v0.12.8) - 2026-10-28\n\n### Added\n\n- *(routes)* route an item by its repositories and classification together ([#3788](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3788))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-core`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.8](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.7...onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.8) - 2026-10-28\n\n### Added\n\n- *(routes)* route an item by its repositories and classification together ([#3788](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3788))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(linear)* keep a private home's public projections through a copy's follow-up write ([#3783](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3783))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-27T18:20:50Z","updat