"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3788","id":5043641893,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABLJ_eJQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3788","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3788.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3788.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3788","number":3788,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(routes): route an item by its repositories and classification together","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAdd routes that match repository patterns and classification together, ahead of classification-only and repository-only routes. This supports organization-wide private routing, specific private-repository overrides and separate public routing while preserving private-destination checks and existing configurations.\n\nIncludes the public `Routes::combined` constructor, configuration and binary journey tests, and README and journey documentation. A configuration test loads the README example and checks its stated placements.\n\n## Why\n\nOwners with both public and private repositories previously had to list each private repository individually. Forgetting a new repository could leave its follow-up work refused at a public board. Combined routes remove that per-repository upkeep while keeping private work confined to destinations declared private.\n\n## Additional info\n\nAlso includes a local Markdown fix for false “escapes configured root” refusals during concurrent file replacement on Windows, encountered in [the Windows check](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/actions/runs/40621097066/job/122595673689). Record lookup and update now use the listing’s confinement rule: resolve and confine the folder, resolving the file itself only when it is a link. The replacement-race test now also reads records by ID during replacements.","created_at":"2026-10-28T01:21:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T04:33:48Z","closed_at":"2026-10-28T04:33:46Z","merged_at":"2026-10-28T04:33:46Z","merge_commit_sha":"c9dbca3e5f1514145d7ae546a22f1b4a32e5a13e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3788/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3788/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3788/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/4df989bac40cb2049286a05487c054bb3987361a","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/3787/otg-org-classification-routes","ref":"nick/3787/otg-org-classification-routes","sha":"4df989bac40cb2049286a05487c054bb3987361a","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1343250630,"node_id":"R_kgDOUBBgxg","name":"onetaskgraph","full_name":"nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https