nts":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3770/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3770/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3770/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/bcaa7ab949c13b38533ef2b400578e67d32d1354"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":{"enabled_by":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3769","id":5009126974,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABKpE2Pg","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3769","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3769.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3769.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3769","number":3769,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(copy): carry an anchor naming no destination into a public projection","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nPublic projections now preserve anchors whose only attribute is `id` or `name`, allowing public tasks with budget anchors to be copied out of private plans. Anchor values must contain only ASCII letters, digits, `-`, `_` or `.`; additional attributes and `style`/`script` elements remain refused.\n\n## Why\n\nThe anchor refusal blocked ai-orchestrator from copying mixed public/private plans with schema-2 budgets onto the board. This unblocks adoption of the work to reduce Codex launch and helper network traffic and quota consumption on dispatch hosts ([oneharness#1442](https://github.com/nickderobertis/oneharness/issues/1442)).\n\n## Additional info\n\nAnchors and fragment links are preserved unchanged; the store adds no `user-content-` prefix. The real-copy journey checks that anchors and links with exactly matching fragments survive together in the public view. GitHub rendering and prefixed-link resolution remain unverified.","created_at":"2026-10-25T21:58:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T23:18:35Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T23:18:33Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T23:18:33Z","merge_commit_sha":"a60ee4e82313f5e7d61995ba194de6921e5bd4f9","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3769/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3769/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3769/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/86900dbd7e84fa0f466b83285212d85c426a0240","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onetaskgraph-id-anchor-public-projection","ref":"nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onetaskgraph-id-anchor-public-projection","sha":"86900dbd7e84fa0f466b83285212d85c426a0240","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscrip