ph/pulls/3767","id":5007581775,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABKnmiTw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3767","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3767.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3767.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3767","number":3767,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore: release v0.12.4","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`: 0.12.3 -> 0.12.4\n* `onetaskgraph-linear`: 0.12.3 -> 0.12.4\n* `onetaskgraph-local-md`: 0.12.3 -> 0.12.4\n* `onetaskgraph-core`: 0.12.3 -> 0.12.4\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.12.4](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.12.3...onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.12.4) - 2026-10-25\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(linear)* [**breaking**] take what Linear stores from each write's own answer ([#3762](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3762))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-linear`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.4](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-linear-v0.12.3...onetaskgraph-linear-v0.12.4) - 2026-10-25\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(linear)* [**breaking**] take what Linear stores from each write's own answer ([#3762](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3762))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-local-md`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.4](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-local-md-v0.12.3...onetaskgraph-local-md-v0.12.4) - 2026-10-25\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(linear)* [**breaking**] take what Linear stores from each write's own answer ([#3762](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3762))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-core`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.4](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.3...onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.4) - 2026-10-25\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(linear)* [**breaking**] take what Linear stores from each write's own answer ([#3762](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3762))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-25T18:42:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T21:35:49Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T21:35:47Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T21:35:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"d5b94ea77c3964a998ea427decbb24b69739a3bc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3767/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3767/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskg