,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3763","id":5005659438,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABKlxNLg","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3763","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3763.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3763.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3763","number":3763,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore: release v0.12.3","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`: 0.12.2 -> 0.12.3\n* `onetaskgraph-github-projects`: 0.12.2 -> 0.12.3\n* `onetaskgraph-core`: 0.12.2 -> 0.12.3\n* `onetaskgraph`: 0.12.2 -> 0.12.3\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.12.3](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.12.2...onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.12.3) - 2026-10-25\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(copy)* remove redundant screening and hosted reads ([#3749](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3749))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-github-projects`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.12.3](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-github-projects-v0.12.2...onetaskgraph-github-projects-v0.12.3) - 2026-10-25\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(live)* never let a finished run's board residue block the live suite ([#3761](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3761))\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(copy)* remove redundant screening and hosted reads ([#3749](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3749))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-core`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.3](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.2...onetaskgraph-core-v0.12.3) - 2026-10-25\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(copy)* remove redundant screening and hosted reads ([#3749](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3749))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.3](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/v0.12.2...v0.12.3) - 2026-10-25\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(copy)* remove redundant screening and hosted reads ([#3749](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3749))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-25T14:35:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T18:20:47Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T18:20:46Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T18:20:46Z","merge_commit_sha":"24dae4c3127b1addacbf9bd5a53fbf01ddb4a57d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3763/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3763/comments","review_comme