":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3761","id":5004935562,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABKlFBig","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3761","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3761.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3761.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3761","number":3761,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(live): never let a finished run's board residue block the live suite","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nThe live GitHub Projects suite now recovers from completed runs’ residue, including project fields. The janitor sweeps all CI-stamped artifact kinds; board pre-flight removes and reports completed runs’ leftover fields and excess board items before judging workload, while keeping active runs’ artifacts counted.\n\nCI cancellation invokes cleanup scoped to that run’s own attempt, preserving other runs’ artifacts and the janitor’s request limits and pacing.\n\n## Why\n\nOne field left by a cancelled run blocked required checks across branches for hours until someone deleted it manually. Correct changes should merge without a person having to repair the shared test board.","created_at":"2026-10-25T12:58:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T16:46:08Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T16:46:07Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T16:46:07Z","merge_commit_sha":"a4f1ca78467a51b13a3c25b870640d97bd2644e4","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3761/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3761/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3761/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/f2f40eb69c513e4ff6543ecc2a37f99d446ca054","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/board-copy-gaps-2026-10-24/otg-live-residue-proof","ref":"nick/board-copy-gaps-2026-10-24/otg-live-residue-proof","sha":"f2f40eb69c513e4ff6543ecc2a37f99d446ca054","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users