scriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onetaskgraph-github-projects`: 0.12.1 -> 0.12.2\n* `onetaskgraph-linear`: 0.12.1 -> 0.12.2\n* `onetaskgraph-local-md`: 0.12.1 -> 0.12.2\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-github-projects`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.12.2](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-github-projects-v0.12.1...onetaskgraph-github-projects-v0.12.2) - 2026-10-25\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(cli)* cut store start-up and plan loading ([#3746](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3746))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-linear`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.2](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-linear-v0.12.1...onetaskgraph-linear-v0.12.2) - 2026-10-25\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(cli)* cut store start-up and plan loading ([#3746](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3746))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-local-md`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.12.2](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-local-md-v0.12.1...onetaskgraph-local-md-v0.12.2) - 2026-10-25\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(cli)* cut store start-up and plan loading ([#3746](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3746))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-25T04:10:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T05:31:00Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T05:30:59Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T05:30:59Z","merge_commit_sha":"fa2c163433351c6a2cea74d584b2b1878779a441","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers"