f":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3738/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3738/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3738/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/759465f51d10f42f808d7682e3654354657115c7"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":{"enabled_by":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3725","id":4991172482,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABKX8_gg","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3725","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3725.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3725.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3725","number":3725,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: support task-owned visibility and private coordination projections","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nTasks now derive visibility from their own classification and repositories, allowing public tasks within private coordination projects while preserving recorded private classifications. Private project copies retain the complete canonical graph privately and create screened public views through existing repository routes, under neutral `Public work` projects without private provenance.\n\nRefresh uses canonical content; status changes mirror only the status category. Private allocation records support interrupted-copy recovery, including destinations that assign IDs. Unresolved references and HTML/CSS that cannot be safely classified are refused before writes.\n\n## Why\n\nGeneralized public work must be executable without exposing its private origin. Task-owned visibility preserves useful public tasks within private coordination, while neutral public views keep planning and execution provenance private.\n\n## Additional info\n\n- Generated Python/TypeScript SDKs and schemas add optional `projection` fields on `TaskStatusSet` and `TaskUpdated`, omitted when unset. The shared `PublicProjections` schema remains version 1 and adds an optional `projects` list; maps without it retain their existing serialization. Other existing schema shapes remain unchanged apart from description corrections.\n- Public-project allocation nonces are recorded privately before creation; destination-assigned project IDs are recorded before views are written. Public projects carry the reserved `onetaskgraph.allocation` key, derived from nothing private.\n- Copy and recopy select an existing public project only by the ID in their private allocation record or by a unique matching allocation nonce across the destination’s projects, regardless of title. Selected projects must remain neutral. Status mirroring requires the view to belong to the recorded project; rollback finds allocated projects by their nonce. Title, repositories, emptiness, a requested ID, or a moved view’s location never establish ownership. Unrelated projects remain untouched.\n- Cache contract versions advance from `ENTRY_SCHEMA` 2 to 3 and `KIND_ENTRY_SCHEMA` 3 to 4 against this branch’s base because corrected schema descriptions change their digests. Entry payload shapes are unchanged; older entries become cache misses. GitHub Projects’ `CONTEXT_VERSION` also advances from 3 to 4 for the corrected classification description.","created_at":"2026-10-24T00:57:49Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T14:03:51Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T14:03:49Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T14:03:49Z","merge_commit_sha":"7f428e0f1a121e4fb5b89bdb1332ddb60f057767","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3725/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3725/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3725/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/5f7863fb60b3462b13599ea2da5ba4c264e3a1b0","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/3719/store","ref":"nick/3719/store","sha":"5f7863fb60b3462b13599ea2da5ba4c264e3a1b0","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1343250630,"node_id":"R_kgDOUBBgxg","name":"onetaskgraph","full_name":"nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","description":"Unified SDK and CLI for project-management ticketing systems: a Rust core with a plugin interface, Python and TypeScript wrappers, and pluggable task sources (local Markdown, Linear, GitHub Projects, in-memory).","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/events{/number}","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repo