:"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nCommit the before-and-after GitHub measurements on onetaskgraph 0.11.0, with sanitized logs, phase and quota breakdowns, loopback budget comparisons, and manager rulings. At real-board size, the bare first copy falls from about 360 s to 29.8 s and host approval from about 212 s to 16.4 s; host operations still exceed their time bars, and every measured copy and approval exceeds its points bar.\n\n## Why\n\nThe loopback budgets alone cannot establish how long users actually wait on GitHub. Keeping measured results beside the agreed bars and the original evidence makes the gains, remaining costs, and future regressions assessable.\n\n## Additional info\n\n- [Measurement report](docs/measurements/board-copy-speed-2026-10-18.md) and [sanitized logs](docs/measurements/board-copy-speed-2026-10-18/) include quota readings and write accounting. No writes reached the real `plans` or `followups` boards; all 88 test issues created were deleted.\n- Host measurements exclude private-source reachability checks and use the documented visibility-inspection stand-in. Write-boundary screening dominates their elapsed time; real-board-size copy figures retain the report’s stated extrapolation limits.\n- Machine-written measurement JSON is excluded from judged lint to stay within its input limit; the Markdown report remains judged. No shipped code changes.","created_at":"2026-10-24T10:39:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:17:53Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T11:17:51Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T11:17:51Z","merge_commit_sha":"acd090b48df41afd4c372851871a98ae2375c7b0","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3728/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3728/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3728/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/7a9d2b28fe3010983abd45b1fa48092f7c58674c","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/3652/measure-after","ref":"nick/3652/measure-after","sha":"7a9d2b28fe3010983abd45b1fa48092f7c58674c","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1343250630,"node_id":"R_kgDOUBBgxg","name":"onetaskgraph","full_name":"nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","private":false,"owner":{"log