raph-local-md): release v0.11.1","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onetaskgraph-local-md`: 0.11.0 -> 0.11.1\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.11.1](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-local-md-v0.11.0...onetaskgraph-local-md-v0.11.1) - 2026-10-23\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(local-md)* write every entry atomically so a reader never opens a torn document ([#3722](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3722))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-23T13:34:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:11:25Z","closed_at":"2026-10-23T15:11:23Z","merged_at":"2026-10-23T15:11:23Z","merge_commit_sha":"f58a1d96766779af1b76bfe579c75c28bd53144b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickd