ttps://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3722","id":4981557309,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABKOyIPQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3722","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3722.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3722.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3722","number":3722,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(local-md): write every entry atomically so a reader never opens a torn document","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nMake every `local-md` task, project and document write atomic, including plain creates, replacements and comment edits. Readers see complete records, and failed file writes preserve the previous record and clean up staging files.\n\nAdd regression coverage for interrupted writes through the source’s real listing and reading interfaces, isolating interrupted writers’ coverage profiles so they cannot corrupt coverage reporting.\n\n## Why\n\nA torn shadow-store document broke onepipeline’s write-back CI while restoring a long-running multi-repository workflow. Fixing the source protects every concurrent reader of a `local-md` root, including plan stores, from the same failure.\n\n## Additional info\n\nReported in [onepipeline PR #1117](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1117), [gate job 120285164472](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/actions/runs/39914592849/job/120285164472).","created_at":"2026-10-23T10:46:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:32:41Z","closed_at":"2026-10-23T13:32:39Z","merged_at":"2026-10-23T13:32:39Z","merge_commit_sha":"58dcf27f5241860a18d411055e9a08a0cf61efa7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3722/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3722/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3722/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/b4e6ad298486017c9eab450cee24e04ad4672057","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Keep-a-long-run-s-driver-responsive-however-large-its-journal-grows-and-stop-it-cancelling-its-own-work/otg-local-md-atomic","ref":"nick/Keep-a-long-run-s-driver-responsive-however-large-its-journal-grows-and-stop-it-cancelling-its-own-work/otg-local-md-atomic","sha":"b4e6ad298486017c9eab450cee24e04ad4672057","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQw