ph/pulls/3722/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3722/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/b4e6ad298486017c9eab450cee24e04ad4672057"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3720","id":4967089495,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABKA_FVw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3720","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3720.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3720.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3720","number":3720,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore: release v0.11.0","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onetaskgraph-core`: 0.10.0 -> 0.11.0\n* `onetaskgraph`: 0.10.0 -> 0.11.0\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-core`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.11.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-core-v0.10.0...onetaskgraph-core-v0.11.0) - 2026-10-22\n\n### Added\n\n- *(copy)* [**breaking**] bind a copy to an existing destination task the caller names ([#3721](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3721))\n- *(copy)* [**breaking**] keep a destination item's status on update when the caller asks ([#3718](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3718))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.11.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/v0.10.0...v0.11.0) - 2026-10-22\n\n### Added\n\n- *(copy)* [**breaking**] bind a copy to an existing destination task the caller names ([#3721](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3721))\n- *(copy)* [**breaking**] keep a destination item's status on update when the caller asks ([#3718](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3718))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-22T12:08:19Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T20:09:49Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T20:09:47Z","merged_at":"2026-10-22T20:09:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"3759333d927567b2607393334ae0962a3e86631d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3720/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3720/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3720/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.