tps://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3720"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3720"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3720/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3720/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3720/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/d7c65612a4e1b5c84432b13939a868fcbd59da3b"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":{"enabled_by":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3721","id":4967723476,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABKBlx1A","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3721","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3721.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3721.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3721","number":3721,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(copy)!: bind a copy to an existing destination task the caller names","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAdd `task copy --target-task <QUALIFIED-ID>` to select an existing destination task after verifying its source and origin. The copy reports `via: target-task` and replaces the stored destination link, so later plain copies follow the chosen task. Invalid targets are refused; conflicting selection options and multiple source IDs are rejected before any store request.\n\n## Why\n\nDuplicate tasks sharing an origin can make copy update the wrong item, while a link to a withdrawn duplicate leaves callers unable to select its survivor. Explicit selection repairs that correspondence without requiring manual edits to reserved metadata.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBreaking Rust API change: `CopyRequest` gains `target_task`, and `CopyVia`, `CopyLookup`, and `EngineError` gain variants. Schema bundle 44 updates both SDKs’ report models; Python exposes `target_task` and TypeScript exposes `targetTask`. `onetaskgraph.copies` remains reserved.\n\nCloses #3014","created_at":"2026-10-22T12:55:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T16:03:59Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T16:03:56Z","merged_at":"2026-10-22T16:03:56Z","merge_commit_sha":"4867f0b3291e0fc74d8643ef52019d8386de832c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3721/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3721/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3721/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/977978f308c1c62a294387a01312dfe586aa3418","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/3704/otg-target-task","ref":"nick/3704/otg-target-task","sha":"977978f308c1c62a294387a01312dfe586aa3418","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.