ted_at":"2026-08-23T00:02:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T23:21:48Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-01T00:47:19Z","git_url":"git://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","homepage":null,"size":16538,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":127,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":127,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3721"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3721"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3721"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3721/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3721/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3721/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/977978f308c1c62a294387a01312dfe586aa3418"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3718","id":4965791203,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABJ_v14w","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3718","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3718.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3718.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3718","number":3718,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(copy)!: keep a destination item's status on update when the caller asks","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAdd `--status-policy source|preserve-destination` to `task copy` and `project copy`, with matching Python `status_policy` and TypeScript `statusPolicy` options. Preservation updates other fields without writing existing destination tasks’ or project items’ statuses or open/closed states. New items always take the source status; `source` remains the default.\n\n## Why\n\nRe-copying an extended plan reopens completed work when the authoring copy still says todo, forcing manual repairs and making finished work appear unfinished. Callers can now preserve board decisions while intentional status write-back keeps its existing behavior.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBreaking Rust API change: `CopyRequest` literals must supply `status_policy`; use `StatusPolicy::Source` to retain existing behavior. The README’s Rust example is updated accordingly.\n\nProvides the store-side policy for https://github.com/nickderobertis/ai-orchestrator/issues/1690. Adoption by `aio-adopt` completes that integration.","created_at":"2026-10-22T10:19:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:06:50Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T12:06:48Z","merged_at":"2026-10-22T12:06:48Z","merge_commit_sha":"9a1228de4ded24223a0269b4f8ece396a76a1210","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3718/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3718/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3718/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/f80799b8f95696d1cebc57aa512996854d8b88e6","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/3706/otg-preserve-status","ref":"nick/3706/otg-preserve-status","sha":"f80799b8f95696d1cebc57aa512996854d8b88e6","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https:/