oject ([#3714](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3714))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.10.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/v0.9.4...v0.10.0) - 2026-10-22\n\n### Added\n\n- *(copy)* [**breaking**] copy named members into an existing project without reading or writing the project ([#3714](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3714))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-22T09:52:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:25:28Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T11:25:27Z","merged_at":"2026-10-22T11:25:27Z","merge_commit_sha":"42883d6cff6d8edbcc987e522cdeb05f76c2faeb","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3716/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3716/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3716/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/cf175a7d18f885882d051d5997f5ca26b2f814e7","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:release-plz-2026-10-22T09-52-44Z","ref":"release-plz-2026-10-22T09-52-44Z","sha":"cf175a7d18f885882d051d5997f5ca26b2f814e7","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickde