n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-core`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.9.4](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-core-v0.9.3...onetaskgraph-core-v0.9.4) - 2026-10-22\n\n### Added\n\n- *(engine)* read the image assets a task holds ([#3713](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3713))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.9.4](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/v0.9.3...v0.9.4) - 2026-10-22\n\n### Added\n\n- *(engine)* read the image assets a task holds ([#3713](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3713))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-22T06:15:26Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T07:51:08Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T07:51:07Z","merged_at":"2026-10-22T07:51:07Z","merge_commit_sha":"7ec5030e9b71c04820b99241fd10e8bd99f090f6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3715/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3715/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3715/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/37f153703b51125217a5dee20d9501e52e5fb912","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:release-plz-2026-10-22T06-15-23Z","ref":"release-plz-2026-10-22T06-15-23Z","sha":"37f153703b51125217a5dee20d9501e52e5fb912","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://gi