ed_at":"2026-11-01T00:47:19Z","git_url":"git://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","homepage":null,"size":16538,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":127,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":127,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3711"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3711"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3711"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3711/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3711/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3711/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/eb9076730e44881e60375baa8b71b30011663dd6"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3695","id":4945292996,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABJsMuxA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3695","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3695.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3695.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3695","number":3695,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(e2e): make the loopback board and the live journey's readiness wait reliable","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nKeep the shared loopback board and its asset and visibility proxies’ connections alive, reducing connection churn and reporting failed socket operations. Give the live GitHub journey’s title search a ten-minute deadline to report every created item, with backoff and bounded diagnostics naming missing items.\n\n## Why\n\nFlaky required checks held the plan store’s release and every dependent step, stalling releases and pull requests across the repository.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe original [Windows failure](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/actions/runs/39500544982/job/118897502084) did not expose the underlying socket error. Earlier local measurements showed peak `TIME_WAIT` sockets falling from roughly 15,400 to 4,500 with connection reuse. That did not eliminate the failure: the subsequent [Windows check](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/actions/runs/39531470241/job/118998176698) exposed a reset (`os error 10054`) while the visibility proxy read the board’s response. That proxy still opened a connection per request; it now uses four connections for the copy that previously opened 256. The reset’s underlying cause remains unestablished, and Windows confirmation remains outstanding. Shared diagnostics now identify failed accept, read and write operations, and client errors retain their underlying socket causes.\n\nThe [live failure](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/actions/runs/39499941270/job/118894977425) exhausted the old two-minute wait while GitHub’s issue title-search index omitted a written task. Readiness still uses that search, which the journey itself exercises; reads by ID diagnose missing results only after the deadline. The earlier observation of an item still absent after nine minutes was **non-convergence**, not evidence supporting a ten-minute bound.\n\nTen minutes is a chosen margin, not a measured worst case. A confirming live journey on this host at commit `9bad71e3` reported all five fixture items at **2026-10-21 10:45:08.762 UTC** (`/tmp/otglogs/live4.log`, fixture prefix `98687961-788822`): 2.6 seconds into the wait, with first visibility observed 24.4, 19.2, 16.7, 7.3 and 4.2 seconds after the respective writes. The full journey passed. The duration of the previously observed prolonged search lag remains unmeasured.\n\nRegressions exercise connection reuse and failure diagnostics through the real binary, and the real live journey entry point against a stand-in whose search converges after the old bound or never reports one task. The stand-in scales the timing schedule by 1/200 and checks deadline diagnostics. No delivery budget changes.","created_at":"2026-10-21T02:09:49Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:28:32Z","closed_at":"2026-10-21T13:28:29Z","merged_at":"2026-10-21T13:28:29Z","merge_commit_sha":"d4b6124ef46d816e91f16ab8cab97dd947b01f0e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3695/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3695/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3695/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/9b67e69b5fc2b47160d207d0742b142e3fea570f","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Copy-a-plan-onto-the-board-and-approve-it-there-in-a-fraction-of-today-s-time/otg-flaky-ci","ref":"nick/Copy-a-plan-onto-the-board-and-approve-it-there-in-a-fraction-of-today-s-time/otg-flaky-ci","sha":"9b67e69b5fc2b47160d207d0742b142e3fea570f","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1343250630,"node_id":"R_kgDOUBBgxg","name":"onetaskgraph","full_name":"nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","description":"Unified SDK and CLI for project-management ticketing systems: a Rust core with a plugin interface, Python and TypeScript wrappers, and pluggable task sources (local Markdown, Linear, GitHub Projects, in-memory).","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":