"milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/deployments","created_at":"2026-08-23T00:02:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T23:21:48Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-01T00:47:19Z","git_url":"git://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","homepage":null,"size":16538,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":127,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":127,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3685"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3685"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3685"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3685/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3685/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3685/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/4301126d903c0b1c9995e0ebb438921281dbf87c"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3692","id":4939358286,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABJmigTg","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3692","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3692.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3692.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3692","number":3692,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"perf(github-projects): write a copied item in fewer requests","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nGitHub Projects copies now write only changed fields and send no mutations for unchanged items, with or without `--expect`. First copies combine issue creation, board membership and parenting, then batch the remaining field and dependency writes.\n\nReplace default fixed mutation spacing with window-based pacing while retaining configured spacing, retry/backoff handling, concurrent-edit protection and rollback. Record counterpart locations to avoid redundant document-reference reads, add seven copy-cost budgets, and keep the loopback pacing journeys within Windows’ process-spawn limits.\n\n## Why\n\nPlans are copied to the approval board repeatedly as they evolve. Copies taking roughly 15 minutes delay both the manager and the user while consuming a GitHub token shared across the host. Reducing redundant writes and requests makes those revisions faster and preserves the shared allowance.","created_at":"2026-10-20T16:59:26Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T21:22:05Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T21:22:02Z","merged_at":"2026-10-20T21:22:02Z","merge_commit_sha":"1a7e48d096a97e6cdf0978f51f7e635398c7f15b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3692/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3692/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3692/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/ea21ce2e419bd1864e90a375a0a0cea5fcf93654","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/3654/otg-copy-writes","ref":"nick/3654/otg-copy-writes","sha":"ea21ce2e419bd1864e90a375a0a0cea5fcf93654","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar