:127,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3687"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3687"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3687"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3687/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3687/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3687/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/782cbf8e2c36aa37467bc9e187ba034694837310"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3688","id":4930537592,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABJeIIeA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3688","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3688.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3688.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3688","number":3688,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore: release v0.9.1","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`: 0.9.0 -> 0.9.1\n* `onetaskgraph-github-projects`: 0.9.0 -> 0.9.1\n* `onetaskgraph-linear`: 0.9.0 -> 0.9.1\n* `onetaskgraph-core`: 0.9.0 -> 0.9.1\n* `onetaskgraph`: 0.9.0 -> 0.9.1\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.9.1](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.9.0...onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.9.1) - 2026-10-20\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(copy)* copy and list a plan without reading the whole board ([#3679](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3679))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-github-projects`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.9.1](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-github-projects-v0.9.0...onetaskgraph-github-projects-v0.9.1) - 2026-10-20\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(copy)* copy and list a plan without reading the whole board ([#3679](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3679))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-linear`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.9.1](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-linear-v0.9.0...onetaskgraph-linear-v0.9.1) - 2026-10-20\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(copy)* copy and list a plan without reading the whole board ([#3679](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3679))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-core`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.9.1](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-core-v0.9.0...onetaskgraph-core-v0.9.1) - 2026-10-20\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(copy)* copy and list a plan without reading the whole board ([#3679](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3679))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.9.1](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/v0.9.0...v0.9.1) - 2026-10-20\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(copy)* copy and list a plan without reading the whole board ([#3679](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3679))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:23:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T04:56:07Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T04:56:06Z","merged_at":"2026-10-20T04:56:06Z","merge_commit_sha":"dd9882d289013b439979bb52674b568019720b78","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3688/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3688/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3688/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/af723568711a40bdfce3d403ca711f6dcca57fa4","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:release-plz-2026-10-20T03-23-06Z","ref":"release-plz-2026-10-20T03-23-06Z","sha":"af723568711a40bdfce3d403ca711f6dcca57fa4","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobe