f723568711a40bdfce3d403ca711f6dcca57fa4"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":{"enabled_by":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3679","id":4920480314,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABJUiSOg","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3679","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3679.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3679.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3679","number":3679,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"perf(copy): copy and list a plan without reading the whole board","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nMake GitHub plan copies and project-scoped reads use project members and origin lookups instead of whole-board scans, batch destination reads, and reuse answers covered by valid change tokens. Add `project list --origin` to find a plan’s copies without listing the board.\n\nThe GitHub live lane pauses below 40% quota at admission, rechecks and cleanup, using the lowest reading from REST, GraphQL and response headers. It re-reads after each reset without a pause cap, records each pause, and proceeds without waiting when the burn rate shows the bucket resets before the session would exhaust it.\n\n## Why\n\nCopying and approving a plan has been taking about 15 minutes, delaying revisions and consuming quota shared by other sessions. Read cost should depend on the plan’s contents rather than every plan accumulated on the board.\n\n## Additional info\n\nPlugin API additions have default implementations and preserve existing public item shapes; protocol documentation and the generated Python client reflect the additions.\n\nSimulated-clock journeys cover first, changed and unchanged copies on 2,000- and 20,000-item boards, asserting identical operation counts and preserved content, relationships, board fields and assets. They also cover orphan handling, reference rewriting, project-scoped listings, origin filtering and token/cache reuse. Pause regressions cover continued waiting across 50 resets. The cache-budget harness serializes commands sharing its single-client clock; Linear’s live token checks allow bounded re-reads for lagging replicas.\n\nCopy budgets and write-path optimization remain for `otg-copy-writes`. Mutation handling changes here only invalidate the new read-ahead state; unchanged re-copies may still send no-op updates.","created_at":"2026-10-19T11:52:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T03:20:55Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T03:20:52Z","merged_at":"2026-10-20T03:20:52Z","merge_commit_sha":"85d67fb12db1094dc4a74ac37086c6250169f213","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3679/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3679/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3679/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/e2c94d52613f3fb3ea6d5f9464bac7d8357d2923","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/3653/otg-copy-reads","ref":"nick/3653/otg-copy-reads","sha":"e2c94d52613f3fb3ea6d5f9464bac7d8357d2923","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1343250630,"node_id":"R_kgDOUBBgxg","name":"onetaskgraph","full_name":"nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","description":"Unified SDK and CLI for project-management ticketing systems: a Rust core with a plugin interface, Python and TypeScript wrappers, and pluggable task sources (local Markdown, Linear, GitHub Projects, in-memory).","fork":false,"url":"https