thub.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3678.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3678.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3678","number":3678,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore: release v0.8.0","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`: 0.7.3 -> 0.8.0\n* `onetaskgraph-github-projects`: 0.7.3 -> 0.8.0\n* `onetaskgraph-in-memory`: 0.7.3 -> 0.8.0\n* `onetaskgraph-linear`: 0.7.3 -> 0.8.0\n* `onetaskgraph-local-md`: 0.7.3 -> 0.8.0\n* `onetaskgraph-core`: 0.7.3 -> 0.8.0\n* `onetaskgraph`: 0.7.3 -> 0.8.0\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.8.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.7.3...onetaskgraph-plugin-api-v0.8.0) - 2026-10-19\n\n### Added\n\n- *(status)* [**breaking**] complete landed issues and skip unrepresentable copies ([#3677](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3677))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-github-projects`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n\n## [0.8.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-github-projects-v0.7.3...onetaskgraph-github-projects-v0.8.0) - 2026-10-19\n\n### Added\n\n- *(status)* [**breaking**] complete landed issues and skip unrepresentable copies ([#3677](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3677))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-in-memory`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.8.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-in-memory-v0.7.3...onetaskgraph-in-memory-v0.8.0) - 2026-10-19\n\n### Added\n\n- *(status)* [**breaking**] complete landed issues and skip unrepresentable copies ([#3677](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3677))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-linear`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.8.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-linear-v0.7.3...onetaskgraph-linear-v0.8.0) - 2026-10-19\n\n### Added\n\n- *(status)* [**breaking**] complete landed issues and skip unrepresentable copies ([#3677](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3677))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-local-md`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.8.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-local-md-v0.7.3...onetaskgraph-local-md-v0.8.0) - 2026-10-19\n\n### Added\n\n- *(status)* [**breaking**] complete landed issues and skip unrepresentable copies ([#3677](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3677))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-core`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.8.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-core-v0.7.3...onetaskgraph-core-v0.8.0) - 2026-10-19\n\n### Added\n\n- *(status)* [**breaking**] complete landed issues and skip unrepresentable copies ([#3677](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3677))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.8.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/v0.7.3...v0.8.0) - 2026-10-19\n\n### Added\n\n- *(status)* [**breaking**] complete landed issues and skip unrepresentable copies ([#3677](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3677))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-19T03:45:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T05:16:12Z","closed_at":"2026-10-19T05:16:11Z","merged_at":"2026-10-19T05:16:11Z","merge_commit_sha":"3519929b43804bd142a60320351312edbfbad97d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3678/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3678/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3678/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/49028b9cb6d3e5960066059cf1aca23f4becbae3","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:release-plz-2026-10-19T03-45-34Z","ref":"release-plz-2026-10-19T03-45-34Z","sha":"49028b9cb6d3e5960066059cf1aca23f4becbae3","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscripti