":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3677","id":4914069815,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABJObBNw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3677","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3677.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3677.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3677","number":3677,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(status)!: complete landed issues and skip unrepresentable copies","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nGitHub issue reads now reflect closure in both status category and name. Add on-demand `task status reconcile` and issue-reference `task status complete`, with library, SDK and plugin-protocol support. Completion reaches all configured GitHub sources, including non-default boards, using batched issue reads without scanning boards.\n\n`task copy --status` filters tasks before reading comments, and destination representability checks let other tasks copy past an unrepresentable item. Contradictory statuses recommend correction at the source. GitHub writes select Status before closing issues, with rollback coverage for refused Status and metadata writes.\n\n## Why\n\nAbout 180 finished follow-ups still appeared actionable, misleading the product owner and risking agents repeating completed work. One stale ticket could also block an entire comment snapshot, while the suggested remapping would misclassify open tickets. Closure-aware reads and targeted completion keep boards accurate without rereading them after every landing.\n\n## Additional info\n\n**Breaking change:** `task copy` now reports tasks rejected by representability checks as individual failures and copies the remainder, exiting `4`. The remaining writes stay atomic; errors during those writes still trigger rollback and exit `1`. `project copy` retains its whole-project atomicity.","created_at":"2026-10-19T00:17:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T03:43:44Z","closed_at":"2026-10-19T03:43:42Z","merged_at":"2026-10-19T03:43:42Z","merge_commit_sha":"fe98c48f17e25b848e7e35904423979cc4b08dc1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3677/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3677/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3677/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/9a31a58448e2a213cf7ad6741443839b89eed8f9","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/3645/otg-closure-status","ref":"nick/3645/otg-closure-status","sha":"9a31a58448e2a213cf7ad6741443839b89eed8f9","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1343250630,"node_id":"R_kgDOUBBgxg","name":"onetaskgraph","full_name":"nickderobertis/onetas