,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onetaskgraph-core`: 0.7.2 -> 0.7.3\n* `onetaskgraph`: 0.7.2 -> 0.7.3\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n## `onetaskgraph-core`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.7.3](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/onetaskgraph-core-v0.7.2...onetaskgraph-core-v0.7.3) - 2026-10-18\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(config)* leave a source no layer defines unconfigured instead of failing ([#3650](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3650))\n- *(deps)* answer a dependency read partially when a private source cannot ([#3651](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3651))\n</blockquote>\n\n## `onetaskgraph`\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.7.3](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/compare/v0.7.2...v0.7.3) - 2026-10-18\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(config)* leave a source no layer defines unconfigured instead of failing ([#3650](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3650))\n- *(deps)* answer a dependency read partially when a private source cannot ([#3651](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3651))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-18T21:34:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T00:41:08Z","closed_at":"2026-10-19T00:41:06Z","merged_at":"2026-10-19T00:41:06Z","merge_commit_sha":"d841430bda78e18f46d3dbc2b5080faa85161fd8","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3676/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3676/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3676/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/67df95b7dc1dc7893e4bb7904121f97b085da9d3","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:release-plz-2026-10-18T21-34-41Z","ref":"release-plz-2026-10-18T21-34-41Z","sha":"67df95b7dc1dc7893e4bb7904121f97b085da9d3","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/ev