null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3651","id":4911352477,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABJL1KnQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3651","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3651.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3651.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3651","number":3651,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(deps): answer a dependency read partially when a private source cannot","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nKeep `task deps` and `project graph` usable when an auxiliary private source cannot authenticate, is unreachable, or is rate-limited. Reads return the available edges, exit successfully, and name unavailable sources in stderr notices and JSON `unanswered`. `--complete` and the library’s `Completeness::Required` retain strict reads; failures of the subject’s own source still fail.\n\n## Why\n\nReaders deliberately lacking an organization’s tracker credential must still be able to load plans. This enables hosts to declare organizational sources private before enabling write screening, protecting private repository names without interrupting plan-store work during adoption.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBreaking Rust API changes add fields to `DependencyRequest`, `ProjectGraphRequest`, and `QueryResponse`, and remove `Eq` from `ProjectGraph`. Library callers can inspect graph completeness. The schema bundle advances to version 39, with both SDKs updated.","created_at":"2026-10-18T17:47:08Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T21:33:21Z","closed_at":"2026-10-18T21:33:19Z","merged_at":"2026-10-18T21:33:19Z","merge_commit_sha":"212dcfa323b79863c95a00c1535fffd356b592ae","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3651/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3651/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3651/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/35e257a7f39ca5f612e494efd729bb88a04de3d3","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Repository-publication-boundary/store-partial-private-deps","ref":"nick/Repository-publication-boundary/store-partial-private-deps","sha":"35e257a7f39ca5f612e494efd729bb88a04de3d3","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderob