rred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nCopies now report when a malformed create answer may have left an item in the destination, including task, document, asset-bearing and project creates. They undo identifiable writes, name the destination and operation, and tell the user to inspect the destination before copying again. Malformed read answers retain their existing classification.\n\n## Why\n\nA plugin can store an item without returning a usable ID, leaving the copy unable to remove it. Previously, the error told users to retry, risking duplicate items or boards. Fixes #3572.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBreaking Rust API change: the exhaustive `EngineError` enum gains `CopyDestinationUncertain { error, destination, operation }`. Downstream exhaustive matches must handle it. The plugin contract remains unchanged.","created_at":"2026-10-18T02:03:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T03:30:04Z","closed_at":"2026-10-18T03:30:02Z","merged_at":"2026-10-18T03:30:02Z","merge_commit_sha":"9632b5b0f71a617135713cd6a6786944bc874344","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3644/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3644/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3644/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/802a8dbea72881e0c8d61f235874f6e4622c1b21","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/public/dda3e07d953f/task-6","ref":"nick/public/dda3e07d953f/task-6","sha":"802a8dbea72881e0c8d61f235874f6e4622c1b21","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1343250630,"node_id":"R_kgDOUBBgxg","name":"onetaskgraph","full_name":"nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.