ssues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/deployments","created_at":"2026-08-23T00:02:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T23:21:48Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-01T00:47:19Z","git_url":"git://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","homepage":null,"size":16538,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":127,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":127,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3631"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3631"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3631"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3631/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3631/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3631/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/63314d9ee8e05295b1599932e8b3ab7e78fac4ce"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3628","id":4871410225,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABIlvSMQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3628","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3628.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3628.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3628","number":3628,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(pool): measure the release pull request's pool-maintenance pass over a warm target","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nSettle the warm build directory with repeated untimed build-and-prune passes before measuring one steady-state maintenance pass. Refuse setup that does not settle within five passes, and retain the errors for a timed pass that removes nothing or removes an ordinary build. Add regression coverage for all four outcomes.\n\nThe 20-second threshold and release-pull-request-only Ubuntu scheduling are unchanged.\n\n## Why\n\nUnblock the release carrying the merged Linear cache change (#3619), which the remaining work to cache and adopt every vouched onetaskgraph read on this host needs. The required budget step blocked [release v0.7.1](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3626) after the preceding checks passed.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe warm target directory contains old cached builds across multiple profiles. The first backlog prune removes some ordinary builds that share a unit name with other variants; rebuilding them supersedes old siblings the prune retained. A single setup pass therefore left extra removals for the timed pass, correctly triggering its self-check. Setup now waits until an untimed pass removes nothing before creating the measured workload.","created_at":"2026-10-15T09:53:26Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T10:20:07Z","closed_at":"2026-10-15T10:20:05Z","merged_at":"2026-10-15T10:20:05Z","merge_commit_sha":"8636662d85505700b1ccc9bce81680a7d106c089","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3628/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3628/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3628/comments","sta