https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3628"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3628"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3628"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3628/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3628/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3628/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/b6eced86278f3bf2a44cfabb25f074bad29840de"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3619","id":4860528526,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABIbXHjg","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3619","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3619.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3619.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3619","number":3619,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(cache): serve Linear comments and dependency reads from the cache","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nExtend the opt-in Linear cache to serve comments, issue reverse dependencies and project dependencies in both directions without a request when the caller’s pin is unchanged. CLI and SDK comment reads, including `--comments` copies, use the task-detail cache path; task and project dependency commands now accept `--pin`.\n\nCopies reuse unchanged projects from one listing page and settle paginated comments whenever the source’s token does not cover them. Serialize the two Linear live-test targets so both run without competing for the same live seat.\n\n## Why\n\nThe shared Linear key’s 2,500 hourly requests are the limiting resource. Comment and dependency reads consumed much of that allowance even with a warm cache. This change budgets request savings over the whole hour, allowing individual reads to cost more while enforcing a 9,000 per-query complexity guard.\n\n## Additional info\n\n- Revised `lin1` tokens cover comments and forward and inverse relations. Entries carrying the earlier spelling are unordered against the new tokens and refetched; missing, unordered or incomplete tokens bypass the cache.\n- A cached comment author’s display name may remain stale after a rename. This is the sole documented freshness exception; author id, comment contents, timestamps and membership remain covered by the pin.\n- Comment and relation writes, including rollback and deletion, invalidate affected cache entries. With caching disabled, Linear query documents remain unchanged from 0.6.0.\n- Copies needing multiple projects read at most one listing page before looking up remaining projects individually: the worst case adds one request.\n- The loopback workload measures 207 requests at 1x and 1,944 at 10x for a cold-then-warm hour; an all-warm 10x hour uses 612. The 10x cold-then-warm complexity is 546,504, and the largest query is 8,880. Absolute usage budgets retain 20% rounded headroom within the agreed ceilings.","created_at":"2026-10-14T15:49:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:16:39Z","closed_at":"2026-10-15T08:16:36Z","merged_at":"2026-10-15T08:16:36Z","merge_commit_sha":"0c707d2710e81b9132c7a00026a2bab714209c1d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3619/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3619/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3619/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/16cb8c6cdb5b3927c6ffea582370d88999017fba","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/otg-cache-everything-versioned-plan/cache-linear-remaining","ref":"nick/otg-cache-everything-versioned-plan/cache-linear-remaining","sha":"16cb8c6cdb5b3927c6ffea582370d88999017fba","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starre