s/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3622","id":4865907941,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABIgfc5Q","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3622","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3622.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3622.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3622","number":3622,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(live-janitor): remove a CI run's residue once that run has completed","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRemove the live janitor’s 24-hour delay for scratch CI artifacts: they become eligible for deletion on the first pass that reads their owning Actions run as `completed`, regardless of age. Ownership checks before each batch, request limits, and one-request-per-second pacing remain unchanged.\n\n## Why\n\nOn October 14, seven leftovers from two finished CI runs kept the shared board above the live GitHub test’s 90-item limit for most of a day, blocking every change’s required check. Finished runs’ leftovers should be cleaned up on the next janitor pass so they stop blocking CI.","created_at":"2026-10-14T23:24:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T03:11:31Z","closed_at":"2026-10-15T03:11:29Z","merged_at":"2026-10-15T03:11:29Z","merge_commit_sha":"2720172fe04bed79c7840ed9f9b660c93c0cf669","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3622/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3622/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3622/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/f14a751f282f7127f3f9c46122742a898e9cffb2","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/otg-cache-everything-versioned-plan/janitor-completed-runs","ref":"nick/otg-cache-everything-versioned-plan/janitor-completed-runs","sha":"f14a751f282f7127f3f9c46122742a898e9cffb2","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"http