":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3625.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3625","number":3625,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(copy): file a private source's documents under the home its copy link names","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nDocument copies from a private source to a destination not declared private now find their home through the source project’s copy link when origin metadata was deliberately withheld. This avoids scanning other route destinations, preserves updates on repeated copies, and reports a stale link when the named project is missing. Other copies retain the existing origin check.\n\n## Why\n\nPlans must be drafted privately to keep private repository names out of public stores. Requiring the intentionally omitted origin prevented their design documents and spike reports from reaching public boards, blocking plan approval and launch. Following the private source’s copy link restores document filing without exposing private provenance.","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:02:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T02:24:15Z","closed_at":"2026-10-15T02:24:13Z","merged_at":"2026-10-15T02:24:13Z","merge_commit_sha":"ae2ee846ae84d085d2521a4ef951e9ea6c0cf914","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3625/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3625/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3625/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/860e7286a9f46450c6e1acd59b4c28312df85848","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Repository-publication-boundary/store-private-copy-home","ref":"nick/Repository-publication-boundary/store-private-copy-home","sha":"860e7286a9f46450c6e1acd59b4c28312df85848","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.githu