.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3620","number":3620,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore(pool): declare onetaskgraph's pool maintenance","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nDeclare idle-slot pool maintenance using `cargo-prune-superseded` 0.1.1, installed by bootstrap. It removes superseded Cargo builds older than two days while keeping each unit’s newest build and all recent builds.\n\nAdd a 20-second steady-state maintenance budget, checked on release pull requests after the quality gate. Ordinary per-change checks do not run the expensive measurement.\n\n## Why\n\nSuperseded build output across the host’s pool reached roughly 926 GB and nearly filled a 1.8 TB disk twice in four days. Repository-owned maintenance reclaims that space while keeping rebuilds warm; the budget limits how long a regular pass holds a slot out of service.","created_at":"2026-10-14T20:06:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T21:40:50Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T21:40:48Z","merged_at":"2026-10-14T21:40:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"728d95a84a38a45305be1c513b3eeb41544a7ad2","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3620/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3620/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3620/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/72c48169bee34e1c658ca7f6b496e74f8ee297d8","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/3591/declare-maintenance-onetaskgraph","ref":"nick/3591/declare-maintenance-onetaskgraph","sha":"72c48169bee34e1c658ca7f6b496e74f8ee297d8","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1343250630,"node_id":"R_kgDOUBBgxg","name":"onetaskgraph","full_name":"nickderobertis/onetaskgraph","private