e,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":127,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":127,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3610"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3610"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3610"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3610/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3610/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3610/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/350695f7994ac44454458e29a448116e49df2435"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":{"enabled_by":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3609","id":4855600023,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABIWqTlw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3609","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3609.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3609.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3609","number":3609,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(cache)!: cache every vouched project and document read","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nExtend the opt-in cache to GitHub projects, documents, image manifests and digest-verified image bytes, and to Linear task fields, forward dependencies, projects and documents. Add project/document version pins, replace GitHub’s token with `gh3` to prevent stale cached reads after label, field-option, relationship and item-kind changes, and introduce Linear’s `lin1` token.\n\n## Why\n\nRepeated plan copies and design-document reads consume shared API allowances, stopping board work when those allowances run out. Serving unchanged records locally leaves more capacity for managers across hosts, while correcting stale task-cache results that could mislead plan readers. Caching reduces Linear’s requests but does not eliminate the modelled 10× workload’s quota shortfall.\n\n## Additional info\n\n- **Breaking Rust API change:** `Project`, `Document` and `VersionCoverage` gain fields. The JSON schema and Python/TypeScript SDKs are updated; project/document versions remain optional on the wire.\n- Older GitHub tokens are unordered against `gh3`, forcing a refetch. Caching remains opt-in; uncovered reads remain remote. Item and byte storage has no age eviction or size cap; `cache clear` reclaims both.\n- GitHub repeat-copy skipping retains a documented limitation: a dependency’s kind change alone can leave its copied edge unchanged until a subsequent copy reads that task.\n- Adds CLI journeys, GitHub credentialed journey legs, and telemetry-backed GitHub points and Linear complexity budgets at 1× and 10× workloads. The GitHub budget workload now splits task loads into whole detail batches to fit Windows command-line limits.","created_at":"2026-10-14T09:12:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T10:32:09Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T10:32:07Z","merged_at":"2026-10-14T10:32:06Z","merge_commit_sha":"bef3883d1b94597e8a0c262cb893358b60b3d84e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":