/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nBuild dev and test profiles without debug information, reducing local build artifacts. Panic locations and instrumentation-based coverage remain available; release builds are unchanged.\n\n## Why\n\nThe commit records no debugger, symbolizer or backtrace-frame use on the host to justify the storage cost. Its measurements show one test binary shrinking from 390 MB to 118 MB and the build tree becoming 42% smaller.","created_at":"2026-10-12T13:49:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T17:08:04Z","closed_at":"2026-10-12T17:08:02Z","merged_at":"2026-10-12T17:08:02Z","merge_commit_sha":"2e33a5a94e7c3a5b3b58ef76b358160fb81387a4","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3594/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3594/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3594/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickd