policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":127,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3593"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3593"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3593"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3593/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3593/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3593/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/f7426a25a2191d69e297f4d99a61493c92930b46"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3587","id":4814800722,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUBBgxs8AAAABHvwHUg","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3587","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3587.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pull/3587.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3587","number":3587,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(tests): keep the live journey's comment-activity check to the items it wrote","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nMake the live GitHub comment-activity assertions tolerate unrelated comments on the shared board while still requiring exactly the expected results among the journey’s own tasks. Place the boundary after both issue and comment timestamps, with loopback regression coverage for unrelated activity, unexpected selections, and missing results.\n\nFix the simulated clock’s reconnect race between successive CLI processes, while preserving rejection of duplicate live clients.\n\n## Why\n\nThis flake blocked the v0.4.0 release and the onepipeline, onepipeline-ui, and ai-orchestrator adoptions waiting on it. Releases should not need manual CI reruns because of shared-board activity or timestamp lag. The clock repair also prevents sequential test processes from being spuriously refused.\n\n## Additional info\n\nIn [the failing run](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/actions/runs/38081007889/job/114297739131), the selected cleanup item was the journey’s own first task. The session recorded one comment write: the step’s [initial `add_comment`](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/blob/d309187d6fe37035fa73cfc90327903280001b54/crates/onetaskgraph-github-projects/tests/journey/mod.rs#L2820-L2836). Deriving the boundary solely from the issue’s lagging `updatedAt` allowed that intended pre-boundary comment to qualify. The boundary now also includes the comment’s own timestamps.","created_at":"2026-10-10T22:12:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T22:52:38Z","closed_at":"2026-10-10T22:52:37Z","merged_at":"2026-10-10T22:52:37Z","merge_commit_sha":"f70f322f51f157920720ee1e594fe1c899dbd8b2","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3587/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/3587/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3587/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/statuses/6c9569116d2291390d92a204bb83ee722954e198","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Make-a-follow-up-ticket-readable-by-a-TPM-and-filterable-by-host/otg-live-comment-flake","ref":"nick/Make-a-follow-up-ticket-readable-by-a-TPM-and-filterable-by-host/otg-live-comment-flake","sha":"6c9569116d2291390d92a204bb83ee722954e198","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_even